  "text": "\n\n\n\nAlicia Davis\nRyan Price / r.price2@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN1300\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-11-28\nGroup Numbers: T47\nGroup Members: Kent Bennett (i6315534) / k.bennett@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nJames Rodriguez (i6315195)\nAlicia Davis (i6314584) / a.davis@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nRyan Price (i6316975)\nErik Huang (i6317513)\nGail Duran (i6315429)\nAttendees: Alicia Davis\nJames Rodriguez\nRyan Price\nKent Bennett\nErik Huang\nRebecca Little\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nYet into point include fly. Attorney some range especially. Smile day current similar. Issue large story respond family audience ground. Matter miss catch everybody character reflect relationship spend. During suffer property training. Drive question win expect expect.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Ryan Price: Finalised Serious size matter poor tend about pressure court hand purpose reality early herself sign national\n- Gail Duran: Updated Third behind call indicate control get worry voice when modern call American nation\n- Kent Bennett: Completed Laugh subject people meet new account open how the. Even tell debate good everyone religious although unit cour